**Limitations:** part of the T3 combinations was already seen in the applied-mode briefings. Matching errors and synonym combinations may remain in the label, so the engine may have hit vocabulary overlap rather than real combinations. The verdict concerns the top {{ V.v('config', 'engine_reliability.verdict.k', 'int') }} and does not guarantee the quality of the very top of a prescription. No prescription was produced with this engine.

